Date: Mon, 27 Apr 2026 14:09:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 02/12] virtio_msg: add virtio message bridge

Add the userspace bridge endpoint, UAPI, documentation, and bridge-owned relay origin dispatch support.

The bridge provides the common userspace-facing endpoint used by later loopback and FF-A device-role providers.

Signed-off-by: Bertrand Marquis <bertrand.marquis@arm.com>
